		.string "Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\n"
	.string "secret with someone.\l"
	.string "I think that this chunk of AMBER\n"
	.string "contains POKeMON DNA!\l"
	.string "It would be a shattering scientific\n"
	.string "breakthrough if POKeMON could be\p"
	.string "resurrected from it.\l"
